Food : The starters were fine and the regular stuff was served, like any other "Grill on the Table" Restaurant. Nothing much to mention about but surprisingly the main course was awesome. Finding a lavish and sumptuous main course at a restaurant with this concept is rare. An extended spread wherein you get massive variety of food from places on the GT Road. This is where the restaurant scores heavily.

